<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66653" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταδόρπιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρπον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in the middle of supper, during supper</i> (as <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
			</span></i> takes it, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταδήμιος,
				μεταίχμιος, μεταμάζιος</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, οὐ τέρπομ᾽ ὀδυρόμενος μεταδόρπιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.194
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>after supper</i>, i. e. <i>at one's wine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄχημ᾽ ἀοιδᾶν μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					124.2
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νυκτερινὴν ἐπίκωμος ἰὼν
				μεταδόρπιον</span> (Adv.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.250
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μ.</span>
			<i>dessert</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				115c
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
